{{Quote|The official uniform of the League of Patriotic Arm Wrestlers, this armor's lycra base layer is supple and sweat-wicking for maximum flexing comfort.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Python Commandos Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

