==Trivia==
* The design of the helmet's mask appears to be based on Yautja bio-mask designs from the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Predator_(franchise) Predator] franchise.
* The eyepiece over the left eye of the helmet resembles the Solid Eye worn by Solid Snake in ''Metal Gear Solid 4''.

